i; done | head -30","time":{"start":1786561980891,"end":1786561980900}},"id":"prt_ff764645a001VKMOiSKnIFIrl5","sessionID":"ses_008a7474dffeDMoYnQ74TeMyw4","messageID":"msg_ff76448a5001wJOBfeZJLmzax7"}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1786561981226,"sessionID":"ses_008a7474dffeDMoYnQ74TeMyw4","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"read","callID":"call_01_ZVwel9hAjj51yL82aafq0319","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"filePath":"/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.worktrees/0145-sk-doc-sk-create-diagram/.opencode/skills/sk-doc/sk-create-diagram/changelog/v1.0.0.0.md"},"output":"<path>/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.worktrees/0145-sk-doc-sk-create-diagram/.opencode/skills/sk-doc/sk-create-diagram/changelog/v1.0.0.0.md</path>\n<type>file</type>\n<content>\n1: ---\n2: title: \"create-diagram v1.0.0.0 - Initial release\"\n3: version: 1.0.0.0\n4: ---\n5: \n6: # v1.0.0.0 - Initial release\n7: \n8: **Released:** 2026-08-12\n9: \n10: Initial release of `create-diagram` as a nested `sk-doc` workflow mode, forked from the third-party `diagram-design` plugin (cathrynlavery/diagram-design) and rebuilt to the `sk-create-skill` authoring contract.\n11: \n12: ## What's Included\n13: \n14: - `SKILL.md` restructured to the required `WHEN TO USE / SMART ROUTING / HOW IT WORKS / RULES / SUCCESS CRITERIA / REFERENCES` order, with all five mandatory connector rules intact.\n15: - The shared editorial design system: `references/foundations/style-guide.md`, `onboarding.md` (agent-mediated), `output-spec.md`, and four primitives (annotation callout, sketchy filter, terminal chrome, icon library).\n16: - All 27 diagram-type references under `references/types/type-*.md`, each with a canonical example asset.\n17: - draw.io and Mermaid extraction (`scripts/drawio_extract.py`, `scripts/mermaid_extract.py`, both stdlib-only) plus their redraw references and `references/import-export/export.md`.\n18: - Registration in the `sk-doc` hub: `mode-registry.json`, `hub-router.json`, `command-metadata.json`, and the `/create:diagram` command (router + presentation + auto/confirm workflow).\n19: \n20: ## Notes\n21: \n22: Content ported from the source plugin was restructured, not copied verbatim, to conform to this repository's frontmatter, section-order, and root-metadata-class contracts. The multi-variant example gallery (light/dark/full per type) was trimmed to one canonical example per type plus a small set of special-pattern examples; the source's own CI/lint tooling was not ported since it validates the source repo's release process, not this packet's runtime content. Full trim manifest and rationale: `specs/sk-doc/028-sk-create-diagram/001-inventory-and-skill-contract/decision-record.md`.\n\n(End of file - total 22 lines)\n</content>","metadata":{"preview":"---\ntitle: \"create-diagram v1.0.0.0 - Initial release\"\nversion: 1.0.0.0\n---\n\n# v1.0.0.0 - Initial release\n\n**Released:** 2026-08-12\n\nInitial release of `create-diagram` as a nested `sk-doc` workflow mode, forked from the third-party `diagram-design` plugin (cathrynlavery/diagram-design) and rebuilt to the `sk-create-skill` authoring contract.\n\n## What's Included\n\n- `SKILL.md` restructured to the required `WHEN TO USE / SMART ROUTING / HOW IT WORKS / RULES / SUCCESS CRITERIA / REFERENCES` order, with all five mandatory connector rules intact.\n- The shared editorial design system: `references/foundations/style-guide.md`, `onboarding.md` (agent-mediated), `output-spec.md`, and four primitives (annotation callout, sketchy filter, terminal chrome, icon library).\n- All 27 diagram-type references under `references/types/type-*.md`, each with a canonical example asset.\n- draw.io and Mermaid extraction (`scripts/drawio_extract.py`, `scripts/mermaid_extract.py`, both stdlib-only) plus their redraw references and `references/import-export/export.md`.\n- Registration in the `sk-doc` hub: `mode-registry.json`, `hub-router.json`, `command-metadata.json`, and the `/create:diagram` command (router + presentation + auto/confirm workflow).\n\n## Notes","truncated":false,"loaded":[],"display":{"type":"file","path":"/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.worktrees/0145-sk-doc-sk-create-diagram/.opencode/skills/sk-doc/sk-create-diagram/changelog/v1.0.0.0.md","text":"---\ntitle: \"create-diagram v1.0.0.0 - Initial release\"\nversion: 1.0.0.0\n---\n\n# v1.0.0.0 - Initial release\n\n**Released:** 2026-08-12\n\nInitial release of `create-diagram` as a nested `sk-doc` workflow mode, forked from the third-party `diagram-design` plugin (cathrynlavery/diagram-design) and rebuilt to the `sk-create-skill` authoring contract.\n\n## What's Included\n\n- `SKILL.md` restructured to the required `WHEN TO USE / SMART ROUTING / HOW IT WORKS / RULES / SUCCESS CRITERIA / REFERENCES` order, with all five mandatory connector rules intact.\n- The shared editorial design system: `references/foundations/style-guide.md`, `onboarding.md` (agent-mediated), `output-spec.md`, and four primitives (annotation callout, sketchy filter, terminal chrome, icon library).\n- All 27 diagram-type references under `references/types/type-*.md`, each with a canonical example asset.\n- draw.io and Mermaid extraction (`scripts/drawio_extract.py`, `scripts/mermaid_extract.py`, both stdlib-only) plus their redraw references and `references/import-export/export.md`.\n- Registration in the `sk-doc` hub: `mode-registry.json`, `hub-router.json`, `command-metadata.json`, and the `/create:diagram` command (router + presentation + auto/confirm workflow).\n\n## Notes\n\nContent ported from the source plugin was restructured, not copied verbatim, to conform to this repository's frontmatter, section-order, and root-metadata-class contracts. The multi-variant example gallery (light/dark/full per type) was trimmed to one canonical example per type plus a small set of special-pattern examples; the source's own CI/lint tooling was not ported since it validates the source repo's release process, not this packet's runtime content. Full trim manifest and rationale: `specs/sk-doc/028-sk-create-diagram/001-inventory-and-skill-contract/decision-record.md`.","lineStart":1,"lineEnd":22,"totalLines":22,"truncated":false}},"title":".opencode/skills/sk-doc/sk-create-diagram/changelog/v1.0.0.0.md","time":{"start":1786561981217,"end":1786561981224}},"id":"prt_ff76468db001oqQcqNy9aBYiYP","sessionID":"ses_008a7474dffeDMoYnQ74TeMyw4","messageID":"msg_ff76448a5001wJOBfeZJLmzax7"}}
