mplates/examples), but export accepts any existing diagram file the user points at, and the packet elsewhere treats rendering/executing unknown source as an execution-boundary violation (import-mermaid.md:153 \\\"Rendering Mermaid to SVG first … crosses an unnecessary execution boundary\\\"). Export offers no warning that the source HTML is executed in a browser.\",\n      \"dimension\": \"security\",\n      \"firstSeen\": 2,\n      \"lastSeen\": 2,\n      \"status\": \"active\",\n      \"transitions\": [\n        {\n          \"iteration\": 2,\n          \"from\": null,\n          \"to\": \"P2\",\n          \"reason\": \"Initial discovery\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"dimensions\": [\n        \"security\"\n      ],\n      \"mergedFindingIds\": []\n    },\n    {\n      \"findingId\": \"F006\",\n      \"severity\": \"P2\",\n      \"title\": \"Feature catalog undercounts the registered aliases\",\n      \"file\": null,\n      \"line\": null,\n      \"description\": \"`feature-catalog.md:168` and `feature-catalog/command-and-hub-integration/hub-registration.md:29` claim \\\"17 aliases\\\", but `mode-registry.json` lists 27 aliases for `sk-create-diagram`. `.opencode/skills/sk-doc/feature-catalog/feature-catalog.md:168`, `.opencode/skills/sk-doc/mode-registry.json` (sk-create-diagram entry).\",\n      \"dimension\": \"traceability\",\n      \"firstSeen\": 3,\n      \"lastSeen\": 3,\n      \"status\": \"active\",\n      \"transitions\": [\n        {\n          \"iteration\": 3,\n          \"from\": null,\n          \"to\": \"P2\",\n          \"reason\": \"Initial discovery\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"dimensions\": [\n        \"traceability\"\n      ],\n      \"mergedFindingIds\": []\n    },\n    {\n      \"findingId\": \"F007\",\n      \"severity\": \"P2\",\n      \"title\": \"`manual-testing-playbook.md:21` states the feature-catalog package \\\"is authored as a sibling deliverable and is not yet present\\\" and links it as \\\"planned\\\", but the catalog ships in the packet today. `.opencode/skills/sk-doc/sk-create-diagram/manual-testing-playbook/manual-testing-playbook.md:21` vs `.opencode/skills/sk-doc/sk-create-diagram/feature-catalog/` (root + 8 feature files present).\",\n      \"file\": null,\n      \"line\": null,\n      \"description\": \"\",\n      \"dimension\": \"traceability\",\n      \"firstSeen\": 3,\n      \"lastSeen\": 3,\n      \"status\": \"active\",\n      \"transitions\": [\n        {\n          \"iteration\": 3,\n          \"from\": null,\n          \"to\": \"P2\",\n          \"reason\": \"Initial discovery\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"dimensions\": [\n        \"traceability\"\n      ],\n      \"mergedFindingIds\": []\n    },\n    {\n      \"findingId\": \"F008\",\n      \"severity\": \"P2\",\n      \"title\": \"The two IR extractors duplicate substantial logic\",\n      \"file\": null,\n      \"line\": null,\n      \"description\": \"`clean_label`, `_has_cycle`, `shape_family`, `analyze`, `digest`, `to_json`, and `main` all appear in both `scripts/drawio_extract.py` and `scripts/mermaid_extract.py`. `.opencode/skills/sk-doc/sk-create-diagram/scripts/drawio_extract.py` (e.g. lines 217, 596, 640, 759, 859, 919) and `scripts/mermaid_extract.py` (e.g. lines 234, 1054, 1084, 1089, 1177, 1312, 1374).\",\n      \"dimension\": \"maintainability\",\n      \"firstSeen\": 4,\n      \"lastSeen\": 4,\n      \"status\": \"active\",\n      \"transitions\": [\n        {\n          \"iteration\": 4,\n          \"from\": null,\n          \"to\": \"P2\",\n          \"reason\": \"Initial discovery\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"dimensions\": [\n        \"maintainability\"\n      ],\n      \"mergedFindingIds\": []\n    },\n    {\n      \"findingId\": \"F009\",\n      \"severity\": \"P2\",\n      \"title\": \"Shipped example corpus predates the current style-guide skin and is acknowledged as such in-doc\",\n      \"file\": null,\n      \"line\": null,\n      \"description\": \"`style-guide.md:50` (\\\"The pre-baked example HTML files in `assets/` were built under an earlier skin. Regenerating them against the current `style-guide.md` is a v5.1 task.\\\") Combined with F001 (1,357 off-grid coordinates, off-grid font sizes), the 34-example corpus is simultaneously the *reference the skill tells agents to copy* and a *non-compliant artifact*. `.opencode/skills/sk-doc/sk-create-diagram/references/foundations/style-guide.md:50`, `.opencode/skills/sk-doc/sk-create-diagram/assets/examples/example-*.html (34)`.\",\n      \"dimension\": \"maintainability\",\n      \"firstSeen\": 4,\n      \"lastSeen\": 4,\n      \"status\": \"active\",\n      \"transitions\": [\n        {\n          \"iteration\": 4,\n          \"from\": null,\n          \"to\": \"P2\",\n          \"reason\": \"Initial discovery\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"dimensions\": [\n        \"maintainability\"\n      ],\n      \"mergedFindingIds\": []\n    }\n  ],\n  \"resolvedFindings\": [],\n  \"blockedStopHistory\": [],\n  \"persistentSameSeverity\": [],\n  \"severityChanged\": [],\n  \"repeatedFindings\": [],\n  \"dimensionCoverage\": {\n    \"correctness\": true,\n    \"security\": true,\n    \"traceability\": true,\n    \"maintainability\": true\n  },\n  \"findingsBySeverity\": {\n    \"P0\": 0,\n    \"P1\": 3,\n    \"P2\": 6\n  },\n  \"openFindingsCount\": 9,\n  \"resolvedFindingsCount\": 0,\n  \"convergenceScore\": 1,\n  \"graphConvergenceScore\": 0,\n  \"graphDecision\": null,\n  \"graphBlockers\": [],\n  \"graphSignals\": {},\n  \"candidateCoverage\": {\n    \"covered\": [],\n    \"ruledOut\": [],\n    \"deferred\": [],\n    \"blocked\": [],\n    \"byBugClass\": {}\n  },\n  \"searchDebt\": [],\n  \"ruledOutCandidates\": [],\n  \"cleanSearchProof\": [],\n  \"searchCoverage\": {\n    \"requiredBugClasses\": [],\n    \"covered\": [],\n    \"ruledOut\": [],\n    \"deferred\": [],\n    \"blocked\": [],\n    \"graphCoverageMode\": null\n  },\n  \"traceability\": {\n    \"summary\": {\n      \"required\": 5,\n      \"execute